    <briefdescription>
<para>Tracks responsibility for materialization, and mediates interactions between MaterializationUnits and JDs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An instance of this class is passed to MaterializationUnits when their materialize method is called. It allows MaterializationUnits to resolve and emit symbols, or abandon materialization by notifying any unmaterialized symbols of an error. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
